spans.s:
बोध॑ a. perceiving, understanding;
 m. waking, becoming or
being awake (lit. & fig.);
 expanding, budding;
 perception, knowledge,
intelligence, wisdom.

बोधक f. ˚धिका awakening, teaching, explaining,
conducive to the knowledge of (—˚);
 m. instructor, teacher.

बोधन f. ई causing to expand or blossom, exciting,
rousing, explaining, teaching;
 n. awaking, state of waking, perception,
knowledge;
 awakening, rousing, instructing, teaching.

बोधि m. f. perfect wisdom;
 m. the tree of wisdom or
knowledge ((r.)).

†बोधिन् a. awakening, instructing, causing to perceive or
know;
 knowing, familiar with, thinking of (—˚).
